<title>HONG KONG: ABN sets warrants on basket of HK finance stocks.</title>
<headline>ABN sets warrants on basket of HK finance stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Friday it is issuing 450 million American style call warrants on shares of a basket of six Hong Kong financial stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Dah Sing Financial Holdings Ltd   0.05  shares</p>
<p> Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd	     0.04  shares</p>
<p> JCG Holdings Ltd			0.1   shares</p>
<p> FPB Bank Holding Co Ltd	     0.3   shares</p>
<p> Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd	     0.1   shares</p>
<p> Wing Hang Bank Ltd		    0.025 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$7.1123    PREMIUM	 12.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.181     GEARING	 4.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98    EXER LOT	20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 17.FEB.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$7.9025    LISTING DATE  20.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
